OL,3,AAsos users receive pop-up notification
OL,4,Aapparently sent by hackers
OL,5,
OL,6,FAsos app users across the UK have seen
OL,7,Fpop-up messages that appear to have
OL,8,Fbeen sent by hackers
OL,10,F"Dear Asos DPO and IT, we have fully
OL,11,Fcompromised the Snowflake instance.
OL,12,FEngage with us, or we will leak it,"
OL,13,Fthe message reads
OL,15,F"Snowflake" refers to a data storage
OL,16,Fcompany, whose popular tools have been
OL,17,Fused by dozens of firms for collecting,
OL,18,Fanalysing and storing data
